Drop variable .ttf font files here. See CLAUDE.md "Velvet theme tokens" for the
required families and axes:

  Fraunces[SOFT,WONK,opsz,wght].ttf
  Fraunces-Italic[SOFT,WONK,opsz,wght].ttf
  Newsreader[opsz,wght].ttf
  Newsreader-Italic[opsz,wght].ttf
  JetBrainsMono[wght].ttf
  JetBrainsMono-Italic[wght].ttf

Source: Google Fonts (https://fonts.google.com/) — download as variable TTF.
